# Vercel builds this branch for dua-pilates.com, the marketing site, and
# Railway builds the same branch for the booking platform. These are the
# platform's files: they have no API behind them on the Vercel side, and
# serving them there would publish the server's source to anyone who
# guessed the path. Railway ignores this file.
app/
server/
shared/
package.json
package-lock.json
railway.json
.env.example
